{"title":"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37e885744434441fc4a5963ac3ed7efd2cbfc558.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)(2)(x)(4) = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/9/d4923f6fc032babdf0dba1334fefec74f334e70c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 4 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ -3 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ -1 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ -4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"418\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/b/3/1b31eaa084a660fbf5ab4b048bb0632000029927.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-1)(2)(x)(4) = -1 \\times 2 \\times x \\times 4 = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"295\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/9/bd93649928d54d0b2772daa223b6806422d7dc4c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-8x = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"78\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/0/d9084353976d1b185ab4e24cf79f369deb05c8ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{24}{-8} = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } -3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"165\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley\">2011 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2011_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2011 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a hre